Welcome to Screenote
====================

Your account is ready. Here's how to get started.

Screenote is a visual feedback tool for AI agents. Upload screenshots, annotate them, and let your AI agent read the feedback directly via MCP.

Getting started:

1. Create a project — group your screenshots by project, feature, or sprint.
2. Upload screenshots — upload manually or let your AI agent capture them via MCP.
3. Annotate with feedback — click anywhere on a screenshot to pin visual feedback.
4. Connect your AI agent — your agent reads annotations with cropped image context via MCP.

